# MSBuild output for apps/products-api.
bin/
obj/

# The generated TypeScript client is a build artifact, not a source.
# `nx codegen shared-product-types` writes it from the OpenAPI document that
# `nx build ProductsApi` emits into obj/, and the Nx Cloud agents have a .NET
# SDK (see .nx/workflows/agents.yaml) so CI regenerates both.
libs/shared/product/types/src/generated/
